{"4020660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pig Commander", "steam_appid": 4020660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Pig Commander, you start with a commander and round after round, form a unique army. Your mission is to build the best possible combination and defeat the final boss on each map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improvised armies in every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic round based battles with unpredictable twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units of different rarity to mix and match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn upgrade points and enhance your favorite troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike mechanics with quick progression and wild combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique powers and abilities that can turn the tide in seconds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powers and unique abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your units abilities to change the course of each round. From magical attacks to projectiles that pierce enemy lines, every action can determine the outcome of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/636965b3fa6926b3a23dea38cc4fc0fe.poster.avif?t=1773248826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/636965b3fa6926b3a23dea38cc4fc0fe.webm?t=1773248826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/636965b3fa6926b3a23dea38cc4fc0fe.mp4?t=1773248826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face formidable enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles aren’t limited to waves of units, you’ll also confront bosses with unique abilities. Prepare for duels that will test both your army and your tactical reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/5eeb8a67041726af95d44c6ec344c8cc.poster.avif?t=1773248826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/5eeb8a67041726af95d44c6ec344c8cc.webm?t=1773248826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/5eeb8a67041726af95d44c6ec344c8cc.mp4?t=1773248826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unpredictable conditions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round brings a new twist: bonuses for the player, advantages for the enemy, shared effects, or even environmental hazards like tiles that rise and damage any unit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/63334b28fbe83ae3e6c159deee82d550.poster.avif?t=1773248826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/63334b28fbe83ae3e6c159deee82d550.webm?t=1773248826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/63334b28fbe83ae3e6c159deee82d550.mp4?t=1773248826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Pig Commander, you start with a commander and round after round, form a unique army. Your mission is to build the best possible combination and defeat the final boss on each map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improvised armies in every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic round based battles with unpredictable twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units of different rarity to mix and match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn upgrade points and enhance your favorite troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike mechanics with quick progression and wild combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique powers and abilities that can turn the tide in seconds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powers and unique abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your units abilities to change the course of each round. From magical attacks to projectiles that pierce enemy lines, every action can determine the outcome of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/636965b3fa6926b3a23dea38cc4fc0fe.poster.avif?t=1773248826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/636965b3fa6926b3a23dea38cc4fc0fe.webm?t=1773248826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/636965b3fa6926b3a23dea38cc4fc0fe.mp4?t=1773248826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face formidable enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles aren’t limited to waves of units, you’ll also confront bosses with unique abilities. Prepare for duels that will test both your army and your tactical reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/5eeb8a67041726af95d44c6ec344c8cc.poster.avif?t=1773248826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/5eeb8a67041726af95d44c6ec344c8cc.webm?t=1773248826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/5eeb8a67041726af95d44c6ec344c8cc.mp4?t=1773248826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unpredictable conditions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round brings a new twist: bonuses for the player, advantages for the enemy, shared effects, or even environmental hazards like tiles that rise and damage any unit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/63334b28fbe83ae3e6c159deee82d550.poster.avif?t=1773248826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/63334b28fbe83ae3e6c159deee82d550.webm?t=1773248826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/63334b28fbe83ae3e6c159deee82d550.mp4?t=1773248826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Pig Commander is a fast paced roguelike RTS where chaos rules every battle. Build improvised armies, pick a commander, and survive unpredictable challenges round after round.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal, Italian, Portuguese - B